  "description": "The Freego Maxx M1-Neo is a mini electric motorcycle for young riders, with a thumb throttle and five speed levels. Suggested rider age: 8+.\n\nTorque: 60 N·m. Top speed: 15.5 mph (25 km/h).\nThrottle-only riding with instant throttle start and five speed levels: 5, 8, 10, 12 and 15.5 mph.\n\nBattery and charging\n36V 7.8Ah (280Wh) lithium-ion battery with a riding range of 10–20 miles (16–32 km). Actual range varies with rider weight, terrain and riding conditions.\nCharging time: 1–3 hours. Charger output: 42V, 2A. Input: 100–230V, 50–60Hz.\n\nFrame and riding features\nHigh-strength steel frame, front suspension fork, cable-operated disc brakes and 16 × 3.0 fat tires.\nG51 LCD display and rear brake light. IP65 rain and splash resistance.\nNet weight: 50 lb (23 kg). Maximum load: 220 lb (100 kg).\n\nPackage and certification\nPackage size: 61 × 11.4 × 34.2 in (155 × 29 × 87 cm). Package weight: 30 kg.",
